      {
        "text": "After Wu clan accepts Fang Yuan under the Wu Yi Hai identity, Wu Qiao has him refine life tablet Gu and soul lantern Gu left in the clan ancestral hall as the symbol of that acknowledgement.",
        "chapters": [
          1220
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
