  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "When Fang Yuan considers killing a righteous path Gu Immortal and using familiar face to replace them, he rejects the plan. Those forces use life tablet Gu, soul lantern Gu, or blood rope Gu, so the clan would react as soon as the target died unless information path methods could deceive those Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          1214
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "sys_gu_immortal"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Every super force and normal force has an ancestral hall. Inside it, life tablet Gu and soul lantern Gu are used, or even blood rope Gu. The first two are common, while blood rope Gu is rare because it is blood path. Small and big sects in Central Continent keep the same pair in similar buildings.",
        "chapters": [
          1342
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ancestral-halls",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "path_blood",
          "reg_central_continent"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After a life tablet Gu shatters, it is like wood scraps. A shattered soul lantern Gu becomes a cracked ladybird and no longer shines with a dark blue light. Both are mortal Gu, so other methods can interfere with them.",
        "chapters": [
          1342
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ancestral-halls",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_mortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When Sister Cui Bo cannot be contacted after going to translocation desert, her life tablet Gu is broken and her soul lantern Gu has turned dim.",
        "chapters": [
          1398
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "dim-light",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fairy_cui_bo"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Murong Qing Si and Yun Liang keep a soul lantern Gu and a life tablet Gu as mutual tokens; both shatter inside her immortal aperture.",
        "chapters": [
          1444
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "personal-tokens",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_murong_qing_si",
          "char_yun_liang"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Southern Border’s righteous path later treats soul lantern Gu among identity type Gu that make disguise hard even with familiar face.",
        "chapters": [
          1588
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "identity-type-gu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "reg_southern_border"
        ]
      }
    ]
